From 3a94eb5987dc80e71e4f2427f5494b22d67e70e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: acidzab
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:36:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [depends] Bump major versions of native and target depends

Backport of xbmc/xbmc#30655 (14 commits squashed) to 22.0rc2-Piers,
on top of kodi_depends_bump_minor_versions.patch (xbmc/xbmc#30505).

The tag predates the PR base, so these files were adapted:
- libffi 3.5.2 -> 3.8.1 (PR: 3.8.0 -> 3.8.1), native Makefile and VERSION
- pkgconf 2.5.1 -> 3.0.11 (PR: 3.0.10 -> 3.0.11), including the 3.0.10
  build changes (no -Dtests=disabled in Makefile and CMakeLists.txt)
- libnfs Makefile: same changes as the PR, without the wasm patches
  that are only on master
